4687 (box 54550): the architect request reached the helper almost word for
word. The D711 editor already passes every outgoing question; its brief now
fails a question that copies the owner's sentences, and the rewrite says the
need in its own words, at most two short sentences, every fact kept.

MODEL-FACING: Misho's yes to the rule word for word, 12 Oct 14:03 UTC (§133).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
